<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Throughout our Christian life</l><l>A storm wind starts to blow,</l><l>Makes us dissatisfied,</l><l>Disturbs our status quo.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The wind is God Himself</l><l>Who causes us to turn,</l><l>To seek more of the Lord</l><l>And make our spirit burn.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>This issues in the cloud—</l><l>Abundant grace He brings,</l><l>His overshadowing love,</l><l>The safety of His wings.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>The fire then consumes</l><l>All that is not from Him;</l><l>It burns and sanctifies</l><l>And makes us pure within.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>God’s precious essence thus</l><l>Into our being poured,</l><l>Electrum shines from us</l><l>The glory of the Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>The living creatures joined,</l><l>Connected by their wings,</l><l>In four directions fly,</l><l>And God’s expression bring.</l></lg>
<lg label="8."><l>Lord as Your move today</l><l>As living creatures, we</l><l>Your radiance would express,</l><l>And Your authority.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
